WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.172
SERSI
We're Eternals.

00:00:03.156 --> 00:00:05.156
We came here
7,000 years ago,

00:00:06.055 --> 00:00:07.665
to protect humans
from the Deviants.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:08.716
[Roar]

00:00:09.852 --> 00:00:10.802
SERSI
Now they're back.

00:00:12.631 --> 00:00:13.555
THENA
It's time.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.059
KRO
You can't protect them.

00:00:17.826 --> 00:00:18.646
SPRITE
If this is what the end of

00:00:18.697 --> 00:00:21.876
the world looks like,
at least we have front row seats.

00:00:22.641 --> 00:00:24.149
PHASTOS
You know what's never saved the planet?

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.149
Your sarcasm.

